<title>FRANCE: Rhone-Poulenc sells distribution unit.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc sells distribution unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc said on Thursday that it sold its distribution unit Fibrochim to Caldic International Beheer BV for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Fibrochim made 1996 sales of some 700 million francs from the distribution of specialty chemicals and additives for the food industry, the statement said.</p>
<p>Fibrochim has units in France, Spain, the Netherlands, Italy and Britain.</p>
<p>Rotterdam-based Caldic makes and distributes chemical products and had 1996 sales of 800 million guilder (around 2.4 bln Ffr).</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
